WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
You don’t even know about the rock team?

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,520
Got a mission some time ago

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,080
It is said that only three people from Tokito's elite team are back.

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,160
He ran back but lost his memory

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,840
To be able to come back alive from such a powerful loss

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,750
Team Yan also has two brushes

7
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,070
That person’s gaze just now

8
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,030
It's like I'm trying to survive

9
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:18,630
suffered a powerful loss

10
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,950
Will it be mailed?

11
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:22,330
Let's ship it. Is it safe?

12
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,490
I think that look is very similar to Ji Tong

13
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:27,020
But a stranger whom Su Wei sought to destroy

14
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:29,060
Why are you looking at me with such hatred?

15
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,700
Wanwan, you really know how to joke

16
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,900
How could it be possible to come in when the loss is so obvious?

17
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,100
Even if you really sneak in

18
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,870
Even Mr. Wang dared to say it when he was at the base.

19
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,150
Team Yan, why don’t you eat?

20
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,910
God's food

21
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:45,580
No worries, I'm not hungry

22
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:48,540
I seem to have thought of something. I need to go back to you. Go and do it.

23
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,580
I can just go around by myself

24
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:51,490
If the rock team gets lost

25
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,490
If you encounter any trouble, remember to call me.
